      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To build composure under pressure, we can incorporate stress-inoculation techniques into your routine. Practice mentally rehearsing challenging scenarios—such as an unexpected system failure or urgent request—to build automatic, composed responses. Incorporate short, high-intensity focus drills during breaks to improve reaction time when you are not actively \"on the clock.\" This systematic practice helps your body and mind build resilience against perceived scrutiny.",
      "source": "target",
